WEBVTT

00:17:59.609 --> 00:18:01.448
"Here's what I think I need to learn,"

00:18:01.472 --> 00:18:03.447
then I would have been on the path out.

00:18:03.471 --> 00:18:05.102
AG: After a major data breach,

00:18:05.126 --> 00:18:07.661
Rachel had to meet
with a senior technology executive

00:18:07.685 --> 00:18:09.085
to help triage the crisis.

00:18:09.109 --> 00:18:11.115
RB: I was just nodding
and scribbling away,

00:18:11.139 --> 00:18:14.806
and then he kind of paused and he said,

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:16.630
"You're not a technologist, are you?"

00:18:16.654 --> 00:18:18.384
And I said, "I'm not a technologist.

00:18:18.408 --> 00:18:20.678
I came here from a business
change background,"

00:18:20.702 --> 00:18:24.000
and he says, "Well, you're going to need
to learn to be a technologist

00:18:24.024 --> 00:18:25.206
pretty darn fast."

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:27.214
AG: Rachel knew she had to make a change.

00:18:27.238 --> 00:18:29.532
She needed to boost
her confidence and figure out

00:18:29.556 --> 00:18:32.739
how she was going to learn
all this new material so quickly.